0,Fali of Baissa - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fali_of_Baissa,"Fali is an unclassified Benue-Congo language of Nigeria, spoken in the town of Baissa in Taraba State. The language is unwritten, and there are few to no speakers remaining.",Fali of Baissa,Niger-Congo
